flowchart TD
    C[Customer] -->|complaint| API[FastAPI Backend]
    API --> MEM[(Supabase PostgreSQL<br/>tickets / conversations)]
    API --> COORD[Support Coordinator<br/>Semantic Kernel]
    COORD --> CLS[Classifier Agent]
    CLS -->|keyword tool + Groq| VAL{Confidence >= 70%<br/>and category known?}
    VAL -->|Yes: billing| BIL[Billing Specialist]
    VAL -->|Yes: technical| TECH[Technical Specialist]
    VAL -->|Yes: account| ACC[Account Specialist]
    VAL -->|No: low confidence / other| ESC[Escalation Router]
    BIL -->|lookup_payment_record<br/>check_billing_policy| MEM
    TECH -->|search_knowledge_base<br/>validate_technical_solution| RAG[(pgvector<br/>knowledge_documents)]
    ACC -->|lookup_customer_account<br/>validate_account_support_request| MEM
    BIL --> RES{Resolved?}
    TECH --> RES
    ACC --> RES
    RES -->|Yes| DONE[Customer reply<br/>ticket resolved]
    RES -->|No| ESC
    ESC -->|create_escalation_ticket| HUMAN[Human Support Queue]
    HUMAN -->|verdict: resolve / reject / reassign| API
    API --> DONE
    CLS -. logs .-> LOGS[(agent_logs append-only)]
    BIL -. logs .-> LOGS
    TECH -. logs .-> LOGS
    ACC -. logs .-> LOGS
    ESC -. logs .-> LOGS
    GROQ[Groq Cloud API<br/>free tier] --- CLS
    GROQ --- BIL
    GROQ --- TECH
    GROQ --- ACC
    GROQ --- ESC
    UI[Streamlit Dashboard] <-->|REST| API
